body: Strict creation must recognize the resolved mutation actor and emit executable canonical flags with honest clear-collection examples. Explicit claim-start must refuse incompatible selection controls without inventing missing options or an automatic retry. Non-interactive scoped init must retain guidance inspection and explicit add actions without changing user-authored documentation. This child records the already reproduced and implemented three-report delivery tranche; the parent feature retains the remaining complete-corpus scorer and cross-surface acceptance scope. Initial failing TDD receipts and subsequent 13-test passes are preserved in parent history. No shipped precursor is reopened.
